  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Scan
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'The <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#55FF55>scan()</color></font>
    command detects the tile directly in front of the robot.

    <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#55FF55>scan()</color></font> is a command that returns a result.
    The result is a <color=#81C784>string</color> value describing what is detected.

    

    Some
    example usage:

    You can store the result in a variable:

    <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF">tile = scan()</font>

    Or print it directly:

    <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF">print(scan())</font>

    

    scan() is useful because it allows the
    robot to gather information about the environment before making decisions.'
  isImageBig: 0
